flowchart TD
    C[Checkpoint and artifact] --> H{Current inputs match?}
    H -->|No| I[Inspect changed input]
    H -->|Yes| S{Operation completed?}
    I --> T[Recompute affected check]
    S -->|Yes| V[Verify stored result]
    S -->|No| R[Resume next operation]
    T --> V
    R --> V
    V --> N[Save next checkpoint]
